MicroCFTA.SourcePruningTemplates.finishChecks : List
    (Option (MicroCFTA.SourcePruningPartialMatch.Pending MicroCFTA.SourcePruningTemplates.Symbol)) →
  List (Option (MicroCFTA.SourcePruningPartialMatch.Pending MicroCFTA.SourcePruningTemplates.Symbol)) →
